    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11696" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεικον-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰκών</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>represent in a
